    <artifactId>embabel-smith-builder</artifactId>
    <name>embabel-smith-builder</name>
    <description>
        The standalone builder product: compile → validate → write, eval, bounded refine,
        security gate, and lifecycle metadata; publish to a folder or git source (local
        commit, no push by default). Exposes a picocli `smith build` CLI.
    </description>

